            <description><![CDATA[<h2>Launchpad 0.3.14</h2>
<ul>
  <li>Compact window adds the missing separator below the search row.</li>
  <li>Vertical scroll mode uses the full window height, distributes row spacing, and keeps a bottom inset so labels are no longer sliced.</li>
  <li>The search menu can switch the window between horizontal pages and vertical scrolling.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
